{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["\n",["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"brack":[["ev","str","^delivered_satchel_intact","/str",{"x()":"flag","exArgs":1},"/ev",["du","ev",true,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n","^She has the satchel open on the table already, and does not","\n","^look up. \"You're the one who carried this. Sit if you're","\n","^staying. I'm not going to make small talk about a dead man's","\n","^handwriting.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","^She stands the way old soldiers stand, which is to say she does","\n","^not slouch even alone. \"Warden business is Warden business. If","\n","^you're here about Harrow, say so plainly. I've no patience left","\n","^for the roundabout kind.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev","str","^\"Just passing through.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Ask about the Weir gates.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Ask what she knows of Doon.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^\"I opened the satchel before it reached you.\"","/str","str","^seals_broken","/str",{"x()":"flag","exArgs":1},"str","^brack_knows_seal","/str",{"x()":"flag","exArgs":1},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^Ask about calling the Assize.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":4},"ev","str","^Leave.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"brack.smalltalk"},"\n",null],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"brack.weir"},"\n",null],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"brack.about_doon"},"\n",null],"c-3":["^ ",{"->":"brack.confess_seal"},"\n",null],"c-4":["^ ",{"->":"brack.assize"},"\n",null],"c-5":["^ ","end","\n",null],"#n":"hub"}],null],{"smalltalk":["^\"Passing through is a fine thing to be, at your age.\" She allows herself","\n","^something almost like a smile. \"I did thirty years of not passing through.","\n","^Recommend the passing-through version, on balance.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.0.hub"},null],"weir":["^\"The Lesser Gate takes a boat and a strong stomach. The old cistern route","\n","^takes neither, if you don't mind the dark and the smell of it.\" She traces","\n","^a line on an old chart without looking at it - she has traced this line","\n","^before. \"Whichever way you go, you'll need the seal or a welcome or a very","\n","^good reason. The Weir does not open for people who simply want in.\"","\n","ev","str","^t_weir_gates","/str",0.55,{"x()":"learn","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n",{"->":".^.^.0.hub"},null],"about_doon":["^Something in her posture changes - not softer, exactly, but less armoured.","\n","^\"Ilsabet Doon buried a husband the river never gave back, and then she","\n","^took the one job on this coast that puts her within sight of where it","\n","^happened, every day, forever.\" She sets down what she was holding. \"I have","\n","^told her to leave that post more times than I can count. She has told me,","\n","^every time, that someone has to keep it. I no longer know which of us is","\n","^being kind when we have that conversation.\"","\n","ev","str","^p_doon","/str",0.7,{"x()":"learn","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","ev","str","^s_doon_husband","/str",0.7,{"x()":"learn","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n",{"->":".^.^.0.hub"},null],"confess_seal":["^For a long moment she says nothing at all, and the nothing is worse than","\n","^anything she could have said. \"That satchel was addressed to me.\" Flat,","\n","^controlled, the voice of someone who has delivered worse news than this and","\n","^knows how to sit with it. \"I won't pretend it doesn't matter. But you told","\n","^me, which most wouldn't, and there is a version of this where that counts","\n","^for something.\" She looks at you properly. \"Don't do it again.\"","\n","ev","str","^brack_knows_seal","/str",{"x()":"set_flag","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"npc_id"},-3,{"x()":"adjust_standing","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n",{"->":".^.^.0.hub"},null],"assize":["^\"The Assize convenes on proof, not suspicion. Bring them a case that holds","\n","^together under questions asked by people paid to find the holes in it, and","\n","^they will act. Bring them a feeling, however strongly held, and you will","\n","^have wasted a morning and some of my patience.\" She taps the table once,","\n","^precisely. \"Ten tallies to call it. I'd have it be worth your ten.\"","\n","ev","str","^r_assize_call","/str",0.7,{"x()":"learn","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n",{"->":".^.^.0.hub"},null]}],"barter":[{"temp=":"min_tier"},{"temp=":"npc"},{"temp=":"price"},{"temp=":"currency_id"},{"temp=":"goods_amount"},{"temp=":"goods_id"},"ev",0,"/ev",{"VAR=":"barter_result","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"min_tier"},"str","^","/str","!=",{"VAR?":"npc"},{"VAR?":"min_tier"},{"x()":"standing_at_least","exArgs":2},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",3,"/ev",{"VAR=":"barter_result","re":true},"ev","void","/ev","->->",{"->":"barter.23"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"currency_id"},{"VAR?":"price"},{"x()":"has_asset","exArgs":2},"!","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",2,"/ev",{"VAR=":"barter_result","re":true},"ev","void","/ev","->->",{"->":"barter.32"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"currency_id"},{"VAR?":"price"},{"x()":"spend_asset","exArgs":2},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"goods_id"},{"VAR?":"goods_amount"},{"x()":"give_asset","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","ev",1,"/ev",{"VAR=":"barter_result","re":true},{"->":"barter.41"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",2,"/ev",{"VAR=":"barter_result","re":true},{"->":"barter.41"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","void","/ev","->->",null],"interrogate":[{"temp=":"annoyance"},{"temp=":"trust"},{"temp=":"min_tier"},{"temp=":"npc"},{"temp=":"secret_id"},"ev",0,"/ev",{"VAR=":"interrogate_result","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"secret_id"},{"x()":"knows","exArgs":1},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",3,"/ev",{"VAR=":"interrogate_result","re":true},"ev","void","/ev","->->",{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"min_tier"},"str","^","/str","!=",{"VAR?":"npc"},{"